# Introduction to Git and Markdown

## 1. Introduction

Markdown is a lightweight markup language used to format text. Git is a version control system that tracks changes to files.

### Purpose

This article demonstrates Markdown syntax used in technical documentation.

## 2. Text Formatting

**This text is bold.Like my project**

*This text is italic.*

~~This text is crossed out.~~

## 3. Blockquotes

> Markdown helps us create clear and readable documentation.

